>\n        <span class="usp"><span class="usp-ic">\uD83C\uDF3F</span><span class="usp-tx">No mold, leaking\nor maintenance</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class="plansel">\n      <button class="plan" data-n="1" type="button">\n        <span class="plan-flex">\n          <img class="plan-img" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0020/3636/7469/files/mc-kb-kit1.jpg" alt="">\n          <span class="plan-info">\n            <span class="plan-head"><span class="plan-name">Living Room</span></span>\n            <span class="plan-price"><s>$89.95</s> <b>FREE</b></span>\n            <span class="plan-save">You\u2019re claiming $89.95 of diffusers \u2014 free</span>\n            <ul><li>1 free diffuser \u2014 your signature space, covered.</li><li>Covers up to 600 sq ft \xB7 2,500+ homes scented.</li></ul>\n          </span>\n        </span>\n      </button>\n      <button class="plan" data-n="2" type="button">\n        <span class="plan-flex">\n          <img class="plan-img" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0020/3636/7469/files/mc-kb-kit2.jpg" alt="">\n          <span class="plan-info">\n            <span class="plan-head"><span class="plan-name">Living Room & Bedroom</span></span>\n            <span class="plan-price"><s>$179.90</s> <b>FREE</b></span>\n            <span class="plan-save">You\u2019re claiming $179.90 of diffusers \u2014 free</span>\n            <ul><li>2 free diffusers \u2014 where you host and where you rest.</li><li>Each covers up to 600 sq ft \xB7 2,500+ homes scented.</li></ul>\n          </span>\n        </span>\n      </button>\n      <button class="plan on" data-n="3" type="button"><span class="plan-badge">Most popular</span>\n        <span class="plan-flex">\n          <img class="plan-img" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0020/3636/7469/files/mc-kb-kit3.jpg" alt="">\n          <span class="plan-info">\n            <span class="plan-head"><span class="plan-name">Living Room, Bedroom & Kitchen</span></span>\n            <span class="plan-price"><s>$269.85</s> <b>FREE</b></span>\n            <span class="plan-save">You\u2019re claiming $269.85 of diffusers \u2014 free</span>\n            <ul><li>3 free diffusers \u2014 your whole home holds the scent.</li><li>Each covers up to 600 sq ft \xB7 2,500+ homes scented.</li></ul>\n          </span>\n        </span>\n      </button></div>\n      <div class="ship-line">\uD83D\uDE9A FREE 48hr Priority-Line Shipping \u2014 Today Only <i>(Save $19.95)</i></div>\n      <div class="navrow"><button class="btn" onclick="go(2)"><span>Choose your scents \u2794</span></button></div>\n      <div class="guar3">\n        <div class="g green"><b>\uD83E\uDD37\uD83C\uDFFC\u200D\u2640\uFE0F Zero commitment \u2014 cancel anytime:</b>If you ever want out, just let us know \u2014 that\u2019s it. We\u2019ll send you a prepaid return label for the diffusers, and every scent you received is yours to keep. No calls, no fees, no hoops.</div>\n        <div class="g cream"><b>\uD83D\uDCB8 Don\u2019t love it? We\u2019ll pay to take it back:</b>If your home doesn\u2019t feel different within 30 days, full refund \u2014 and we pay the return shipping. No questions asked.</div>\n        <div class="g lav"><b>\u221E Lifetime Warranty:</b>You\u2019re fully covered against malfunctions, leaks, anything. We replace it. Forever.</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class="step" id="s2">\n      <div class="steptitle">It\u2019s time to decide what you want to <em>attract for your life.</em></div>\n      <div class="stepsub" id="hint2">Pick <b>3</b> scents \u2014 every scent you pick comes with a free diffuser.</div>\n      <div class="reserved" id="reserved">\uD83C\uDF89 Your <b>3</b> free diffusers are reserved \u2014 pick your scents to claim them.</div>\n      <div class="pickcount" id="pickcount"><b>0</b> of 3 picked</div>\n      <div class="booklet-obj">\n        <img class="booklet-img" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0020/3636/7469/files/15_4c9e6b44-6d32-41