-desc"><b class="pick-ings">Huckleberry, Wild Juniper & Mountain Fern</b></span>\n        <span class="pick-tags"><span class="tagpill" style="background:#3D6B52">Calming</span><span class="tagpill" style="background:#2D4059">Winding Down</span><span class="tagpill" style="background:#6B4F44">Earthy & Woody</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class="pick" data-key="midnight" style="--grad:linear-gradient(160deg,#C8EEE9 0%,#F6C6DF 100%)">\n        <div class="pick-row">\n          <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0020/3636/7469/files/mc-kb-frag7.jpg" alt="Midnight Sensation">\n          <span class="pick-txt"><span class="pick-name">Midnight Sensation \uD83C\uDFC6</span><span class="pick-int">Love Manifestation</span></span>\n          <span class="stepper"><button class="sub" aria-label="remove one">\u2212</button><span class="qty">0</span><button class="add" aria-label="add one">+</button></span>\n        </div>\n        <span class="pick-desc"><b class="pick-ings">Moonflower, Night Lily & Skin Musk</b></span>\n        <span class="pick-tags"><span class="tagpill" style="background:#9C3D5F">Romantic</span><span class="tagpill" style="background:#8B1A3A">Date Night</span><span class="tagpill" style="background:#A84A6E">Floral & Soft</span></span>\n      </div></div>\n      <div class="navrow"><button class="btn secondary" onclick="go(1)">\u2190</button>\n        <button class="btn" id="reviewbtn" disabled onclick="go(3)"><span>Pick 3 more scents \u2794</span></button></div>\n      <div class="guar3">\n        <div class="g green"><b>\uD83E\uDD37\uD83C\uDFFC\u200D\u2640\uFE0F Zero commitment \u2014 cancel anytime:</b>If you ever want out, just let us know \u2014 that\u2019s it. We\u2019ll send you a prepaid return label for the diffusers, and every scent you received is yours to keep. No calls, no fees, no hoops.</div>\n        <div class="g cream"><b>\uD83D\uDCB8 Don\u2019t love it? We\u2019ll pay to take it back:</b>If your home doesn\u2019t feel different within 30 days, full refund \u2014 and we pay the return shipping. No questions asked.</div>\n        <div class="g lav"><b>\u221E Lifetime Warranty:</b>You\u2019re fully covered against malfunctions, leaks, anything. We replace it. Forever.</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class="step" id="s3">\n      <div class="steptitle">Your kit is <em>ready.</em></div>\n      <div class="kitcart" id="kitcart"></div>\n      <div class="valline" id="valline"></div>\n\n      <div class="due"><span class="due-k">Due today:</span><span class="due-v" id="duetoday">$0.00</span></div>\n      <div class="pay4" id="pay4">or 4 interest-free payments with Shop Pay</div>\n\n      <div class="navrow"><button class="btn secondary" onclick="go(2)">\u2190</button>\n        <button class="btn" onclick="joinToast()"><span>Claim My Free Diffusers \u2794</span><span class="btn-sub">Only 19 free-diffuser kits left!</span></button></div>\n\n      <div class="guar3">\n        <div class="g green"><b>\uD83E\uDD37\uD83C\uDFFC\u200D\u2640\uFE0F Zero commitment \u2014 cancel anytime:</b>If you ever want out, just let us know \u2014 that\u2019s it. We\u2019ll send you a prepaid return label for the diffusers, and every scent you received is yours to keep. No calls, no fees, no hoops.</div>\n        <div class="g cream"><b>\uD83D\uDCB8 Don\u2019t love it? We\u2019ll pay to take it back:</b>If your home doesn\u2019t feel different within 30 days, full refund \u2014 and we pay the return shipping. No questions asked.</div>\n        <div class="g lav"><b>\u221E Lifetime Warranty:</b>You\u2019re fully covered against malfunctions, leaks, anything. We replace it. Forever.</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class="perkhead">This is what you\u2019re about to get becoming a <em>Manifestation Ritual Circle Member:</em></div>\n      <div class="offer-terms">\n        <div class="term-row"><span class="term-ic">\uD83C\uDF81</span><span><strong>Your diffusers ship free</strong> with your first scents \u2014 on your third delivery they\u2019re permanently yours.</span></div>\n        <div class="term-row"><span class="term-ic">\uD83D\uDD04</span><span>Renews monthly at $39.95 per scent. <strong>Swap intentions anytime.</strong></span></div>\n        <div class="term-row"><span class="term-ic">\uD83D\uDE9A</span><span><strong>Free shipping, always</strong> \u2014 on every delivery and everything you add.</span></div>\n        <div class="term-row"><span class="term-ic">\u2728</span><span><strong>First access to new scents</strong> and member-only launches.</span></div>\n        <div class="term-row"><span class="term-ic">\uD83D\uDEE1\uFE0F</span><span><strong>30-day guarantee:</strong> full refund, prepaid return label, and the scent stays with you.</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class="testi2">\n        <span class="tmark">\u201C</span>\n        <div class="tstars">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div>\n        <p class="tq">I tied my intention to Golden Blossom Harmony and let it fill my living room every evening. I stopped \u2018manifesting love\u2019 somewhere around month two \u2014 because by then I was setting the table for two.</p>\n        <div class="twhor"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0020/3636/7469/files/mc-kb-guests.jpg" alt="">\n          <span><b>Mariana V.</b><span class="tv">\u2713 Verified Circle member \xB7 January 2026</span></span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class="minirevs">\n        <div class="minirev"><span class="mstars">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</span>My ultrasonic grew mold twice. This one I haven\u2019t touched once \u2014 no water, nothing to clean.<span class="mwho">Priya T. \xB7 \u2713 Verified Circle member</span></div>\n        <div class="minirev"><span class="mstars">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</span>Two cats, an allergic husband, zero problems. First home fragrance we all agree on.<span class="mwho">Kelsey M. \xB7 \u2713 Verified Circle member</span></div>\n        <div class="minirev"><span class="mstars">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</span>I did the math on my candle habit and switched. One bottle lasted me five weeks \u2014 and the diffusers cost me nothing.<span class="mwho">Amanda J. \xB7 \u2713 Verified Circle member</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class="trust-strip"><span>\uD83D\uDD12 Secure checkout</span><span>\uD83D\uDE9A Free shipping</span><span>\uD83D\uDEE1\uFE0F Lifetime warranty</span></div>\n\n      <div class="faqs">\n        <details><summary>When am I charged?</summary><p>Today you pay only for your scents. Then the same amount renews monthly as each new box ships. You get an email reminder before every renewal.</p></details>\n        <details><summary>Can I swap scents?</summary><p>Yes \u2014 swap any of your intentions before any delivery, right from your delivery email. No calls, no forms.</p></details>\n        <details><summary>What if I cancel?</summary><p>Cancel anytime from any delivery email. Within the first 30 days we refund every dollar and send a prepaid label for the diffusers \u2014 the scents stay with you.</p></details>\n        <details><summary>Is the diffuser really free?</summary><p>Yes. Today you pay only for your scents \u2014 the diffusers ship free with your first box, and on your third delivery they\u2019re permanently yours. Cancel in the first 30 days and we refund every dollar and send prepaid return labels for the diffusers \u2014 the scents stay with you.</p></details>\n        <details><summary>How long does each bottle last?</summary><p>30+ days of continuous diffusion per 100ml bottle \u2014 about 10x longer than burning candles. Your next scent arrives before the last one runs out, so you\u2019re never without.</p></details>\n        <details><summary>Is it safe for pets and kids?</summary><p>Yes. 100% waterless, no heat, no mold, and organic scent compositions that are safe around your whole household.</p></details>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class="toast" id="toast"></div>';var VAR={love:41212020457581,abundance:41212018655341,focus:41212021506157,ideas:41212021342317,energy:41212020752493,purify:41212021669997,midnight:41212019933293},PLAN=2627895405,DIFF=45450822778989,P=39.95,DV=89.95,N=3,picks={},STEP=1;(function(){var el=document.getElementById("cd");function tick(){var now=new Date,end=new Date(now);end.setHours(23,59,59,999);var d=Math.max(0,end-now),h=String(Math.floor(d/36e5)).padStart(2,"0"),m=String(Math.floor(d%36e5/6e4)).padStart(2,"0"),x=String(Math.floor(d%6e4/1e3)).padStart(2,"0");el.textContent=h+":"+m+":"+x}tick(),setInterval(tick,1e3)})();var FR={love:{name:"Golden Blossom Harmony"},abundance:{name:"Crisp Citrus Scape"},focus:{name:"Chilled Citrus"},ideas:{name:"Honey Nectar"},energy:{name:"Euphoric Bloom"},purify:{name:"Wildwood Mystique"},midnight:{name:"Midnight Sensation"}};(function(){var tr=document.getElementById("kbgtrack");if(!tr)return;var ths=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll(".kbg-th"));function setOn(i){ths.forEach(function(t,j){t.classList.toggle("on",j===i)}),ths[i]&&ths[i].scrollIntoView({block:"nearest",inline:"center",behavior:"smooth"})}ths.forEach(function(t,i){t.onclick=function(){tr.scrollTo({left:tr.clientWidth*i,behavior:"smooth"})}});function cur(){return Math.round(tr.scrollLeft/tr.clientWidth)}function goTo(i){i=Math.max(0,Math.min(ths.length-1,i)),tr.scrollTo({left:tr.clientWidth*i,behavior:"smooth"})}var pv=document.getElementById("kbgprev"),nx=document.getElementById("kbgnext");pv&&(pv.onclick=function(){goTo(cur()-1)}),nx&&(nx.onclick=function(){goTo(cur()+1)});var deb;tr.addEventListener("scroll",function(){clearTimeout(deb),deb=setTimeout(function(){setOn(Math.round(tr.scrollLeft/tr.clientWidth))},80)},{passive:!0})})(),document.querySelectorAll(".plan").forEach(function(p){p.onclick=function(){document.querySelectorAll(".plan").forEach(function(x){x.classList.remove("on")}),p.classList.add(